    {
      "document_id": "D001",
      "title": "CUDA 缓存分配器与显存统计",
      "category": "cuda_oom",
      "url": "https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.9/notes/cuda.html#memory-management",
      "applicable_version": "PyTorch 2.9",
      "collected_at": "2026-11-03T12:24:00+08:00",
      "content_kind": "curated_summary",
      "keywords": [
        "CUDA",
        "OOM",
        "out of memory",
        "显存不足",
        "memory_reserved",
        "缓存分配器"
      ],
      "excerpt": "PyTorch 使用缓存分配器。memory_allocated 统计张量占用，memory_reserved 统计分配器管理的显存；未使用的缓存仍可显示在 nvidia-smi 中。empty_cache 释放未使用缓存，不释放仍被张量占用的显存。"
    },
    {
      "document_id": "D002",
      "title": "memory_allocated 当前张量显存",
      "category": "cuda_oom",
      "url": "https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.9/generated/torch.cuda.memory.memory_allocated.html",
      "applicable_version": "PyTorch 2.9",
      "collected_at": "2026-11-03T12:24:00+08:00",
      "content_kind": "curated_summary",
      "keywords": [
        "memory_allocated",
        "显存",
        "字节",
        "nvidia-smi",
        "GPU"
      ],
      "excerpt": "torch.cuda.memory_allocated(device) 返回指定设备上当前张量占用的 GPU 显存字节数。未指定设备时使用当前设备。缓存与 CUDA 上下文会使 nvidia-smi 显示值高于该统计。"
    },
    {
      "document_id": "D003",
      "title": "empty_cache 的释放范围",
      "category": "cuda_oom",
      "url": "https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.9/generated/torch.cuda.memory.empty_cache.html",
      "applicable_version": "PyTorch 2.9",
      "collected_at": "2026-11-03T12:24:00+08:00",
      "content_kind": "curated_summary",
      "keywords": [
        "empty_cache",
        "OOM",
        "out of memory",
        "显存不足",
        "碎片化",
        "缓存"
      ],
      "excerpt": "empty_cache 将分配器中未占用的缓存释放给其他 GPU 应用使用。它不会增加 PyTorch 可使用的显存容量；在部分情况下有助于减少碎片化。"
    },
    {
      "document_id": "D004",
      "title": "Tensor.to 返回设备或类型转换后的张量",
      "category": "device_mismatch",
      "url": "https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.9/generated/torch.Tensor.to.html",
      "applicable_version": "PyTorch 2.9",
      "collected_at": "2026-11-03T12:24:00+08:00",
      "content_kind": "curated_summary",
      "keywords": [
        "Tensor.to",
        "device mismatch",
        "same device",
        "设备不一致",
        "cpu",
        "cuda",
        "dtype"
      ],
      "excerpt": "Tensor.to 返回指定设备或 dtype 的张量。设备和类型均已匹配时可以返回原张量，否则返回转换后的副本。使用转换结果需要接收返回值；to(other) 可匹配另一个张量的设备和类型。"
    },
    {
      "document_id": "D005",
      "title": "Module.to 迁移参数与缓冲区",
      "category": "device_mismatch",
      "url": "https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.9/generated/torch.nn.Module.html#torch.nn.Module.to",
      "applicable_version": "PyTorch 2.9",
      "collected_at": "2026-11-03T12:24:00+08:00",
      "content_kind": "curated_summary",
      "keywords": [
        "Module.to",
        "model.to",
        "parameters",
        "buffers",
        "设备不一致",
        "模型迁移"
      ],
      "excerpt": "Module.to 迁移或转换模块的参数与缓冲区，并原地修改模块。指定 dtype 时仅转换浮点或复数参数和缓冲区；整数参数和缓冲区可迁移设备但保留类型。"
    },
    {
      "document_id": "D006",
      "title": "torch.tensor 创建时的设备选择",
      "category": "device_mismatch",
      "url": "https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.9/generated/torch.tensor.html",
      "applicable_version": "PyTorch 2.9",
      "collected_at": "2026-11-03T12:24:00+08:00",
      "content_kind": "curated_summary",
      "keywords": [
        "torch.tensor",
        "device",
        "新建张量",
        "中间张量",
        "设备不一致",
        "cpu",
        "cuda"
      ],
      "excerpt": "torch.tensor 可以显式指定 device。device 为 None 且 data 为张量时沿用 data 的设备；data 不是张量时使用当前设备。创建中间张量时可显式传入所需设备。"
    },
    {
